---
import ContentsBase from "../../UIcontent/background/ContentsBase.astro";
import FontAwesomeIcon from "../../../layouts/FontAwesomeIcon.astro";
import { faSquareBluesky } from "@fortawesome/free-brands-svg-icons";
import { faSquareXTwitter } from "@fortawesome/free-brands-svg-icons";
import { faInstagram } from "@fortawesome/free-brands-svg-icons";
import ContactButton from "./ContactButton.astro";
---

<ContentsBase>
  <div class="contents-wrapper">
    <div class="about-text">
      現在、◯月以降のお仕事を承っております。<br />
      お仕事の依頼をご検討中の方は、下記依頼ページの内容をご参照ください。<br />
    </div>
    <div class="request-link"><ContactButton /></div>
    <div class="social-container">
      <div class="address-wrapper">
        <div class="header">Mail</div>
        <div class="address">sample.adress@gmail.com</div>
      </div>
      <div class="social-link-wrapper">
        <div class="header">SNS</div>
        <div class="social-links">
          <a class="social-link" href="https://x.com/tabi_0v0" target="_blank"
            ><FontAwesomeIcon icon={faSquareXTwitter} /></a
          >
          <a
            class="social-link"
            href="https://www.instagram.com/tabi_0v0/"
            target="_blank"><FontAwesomeIcon icon={faInstagram} /></a
          >
          <a
            class="social-link"
            href="https://bsky.app/profile/tabi-0v0.bsky.social"
            target="_blank"><FontAwesomeIcon icon={faSquareBluesky} /></a
          >
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- <a href="/"><i class="fa-brands fa-square-bluesky"></i></a> -->
    </div>
  </div>
</ContentsBase>

<div class="footer-wrapper">
  Copyright ©2023 tabi:)
  当サイトの内容、テキスト、画像等の無断転載・無断使用を固く禁じます。<br />
  Unauthorized reproduction or use of the contents, text, images, etc. of this website
  is strictly prohibited.
</div>

<style>
  .contents-wrapper {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: center;
    flex-direction: column;
  }

  .footer-wrapper {
    height: 150px;
    /* width: 30%; */
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: end;
    text-align: center;
    padding-bottom: 5px;
    font-size: 10px;
    color: #1d2027;
    opacity: 0.4;
  }
  .about-text {
    width: 70%;
    text-align: center;
    margin: 40px 0 28px 0;
    font-family: "M PLUS Rounded 1c";
  }

  .header {
    width: 20%;
    border-bottom: 2px dotted #000;
    font-family: "Lexend Deca";
    font-size: 20px;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
    /* display: inline-block; */
  }
  .social-container {
    width: 70%;
    margin-top: 40px;
    color: #626262;
  }

  .address-wrapper {
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }
  .address {
    font-family: "Lexend Deca";
    font-size: 18px;
  }
  .social-link {
    font-size: 40px;
    color: #626262;
  }

  .social-link:hover {
    opacity: 0.5;
    color: #5fd3c6;
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 839px) {
    .about-text {
      font-size: 14px;
    }
    .social-link-wrapper {
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }
  }
</style>
